<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/" version="2.0"><channel><title>彭博社 实时热点</title><link>https://feeds.bloomberg.com/markets/news.rss</link><description>彭博社 自动中文翻译源</description><docs>http://www.rssboard.org/rss-specification</docs><generator>python-feedgen</generator><lastBuildDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 02:00:03 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>澳大利亚资本支出自数据中心采矿热潮以来大幅飙升</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/australia-capex-surges-by-most-since-mining-boom-on-data-centers</link><description>受数据中心相关支出的推动，澳大利亚商业投资出现了自截至 9 月份采矿业繁荣顶峰以来的最大涨幅，这为原本降温的经济带来了亮点。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/australia-capex-surges-by-most-since-mining-boom-on-data-centers'&gt;澳大利亚资本支出自数据中心采矿热潮以来大幅飙升&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Australia Capex Surges by Most Since Mining Boom on Data Centers&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/australia-capex-surges-by-most-since-mining-boom-on-data-centers</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 01:01:57 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>卢拉提议布拉德斯科的路易斯·特拉布科加入他的政府</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/lula-sounds-out-bradesco-s-luiz-trabuco-to-join-his-government</link><description>据知情人士透露，总统路易斯·伊纳西奥·卢拉·达席尔瓦已向布拉德斯科主席路易斯·卡洛斯·特拉布科·卡皮试探加入其第四届政府，此举可能有助于缓解投资者对巴西不断恶化的财政前景的担忧。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/lula-sounds-out-bradesco-s-luiz-trabuco-to-join-his-government'&gt;卢拉提议布拉德斯科的路易斯·特拉布科加入他的政府&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Lula Sounds Out Bradesco’s Luiz Trabuco to Join His Government&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/lula-sounds-out-bradesco-s-luiz-trabuco-to-join-his-government</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 01:07:45 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>11 月 26 日最新石油市场新闻和分析</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/latest-oil-market-news-and-analysis-for-nov-26</link><description>由于中东持续的敌对行动可能破坏该地区原油出口的复苏，石油价格连续两天上涨。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/latest-oil-market-news-and-analysis-for-nov-26'&gt;11 月 26 日最新石油市场新闻和分析&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Latest Oil Market News and Analysis for Nov. 26&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/latest-oil-market-news-and-analysis-for-nov-26</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 23:03:15 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>《华尔街日报》称，第三季度态势感知能力下降了 65%</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/situational-awareness-ai-65-hedge-fund-third-quarter-wsj-says</link><description>据《华尔街日报》报道，Situational Awareness 告诉投资者，在对人工智能公司的高杠杆押注几乎导致该对冲基金 7 月份破产后，该公司第三季度扣除费用后损失了 65%。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/situational-awareness-ai-65-hedge-fund-third-quarter-wsj-says'&gt;《华尔街日报》称，第三季度态势感知能力下降了 65%&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Situational Awareness Lost 65% in Wild Third Quarter, WSJ Says&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/situational-awareness-ai-65-hedge-fund-third-quarter-wsj-says</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 01:11:41 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>亚洲股市在美国尾盘反弹后有望上涨：市场结束</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/stock-market-today-dow-s-p-live-updates</link><description>在华尔街后期复苏将纳斯达克100指数从熊市边缘拉出来之后，亚洲股市似乎有望小幅上涨，同时对人工智能交易可持续性的持续担忧提振了美国国债。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/stock-market-today-dow-s-p-live-updates'&gt;亚洲股市在美国尾盘反弹后有望上涨：市场结束&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Asian Stocks Rise as Tech Gains in Taiwan, Korea: Markets Wrap&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/stock-market-today-dow-s-p-live-updates</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 22:10:42 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>